<div class="text-center py-5">
  <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold"><%= ENV.fetch("APP_NAME", "UnityUpdates Demo") %></h1>
  <p class="lead text-muted mt-2"><%= ENV.fetch("APP_TAGLINE", "") %></p>
  <p class="text-muted mx-auto mt-3" style="max-width: 640px;">
    Writing for a community you live in is frightening, and the hard part is not the writing. It is knowing which
    of the things you heard you can stand behind. Put in your reporting notes and the sources you have. The source
    check lists every factual claim with its sourcing, says how to firm up the weak ones, and tells you who is
    affected but not heard. It never writes the story, never invents a source, and never says whether a claim is
    true. You write every word.
  </p>
  <div class="mt-4 d-flex justify-content-center gap-3">
    <% if signed_in? %>
      <%= link_to "Go to my story drafts", story_drafts_path, class: "btn btn-primary btn-lg" %>
    <% else %>
      <%= link_to "Try it free", sign_up_path, class: "btn btn-primary btn-lg" %>
      <%= link_to "Sign in", sign_in_path, class: "btn btn-outline-secondary btn-lg" %>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</div>

<hr class="my-5 opacity-25">

<div class="mx-auto" style="max-width: 900px;">
  <h2 class="h5 text-muted text-center mb-4">Example: a fictional neighborhood association&rsquo;s garden story</h2>

  <div class="card mb-3">
    <div class="card-body">
      <p class="text-muted small mb-1">The notes <span class="story-label ms-1">Reported</span></p>
      <p class="mb-2 fst-italic notes-text">The board voted 5-2 on March 12 to put the Fenwick Street garden lot up for sale.
The lot was appraised at $84,000 last year.
Gardeners were not told before the vote. Several are furious and say the board rushed it through.</p>
      <p class="text-muted small mb-0">Sources: Board minutes, March 12 meeting (document) &middot; Ines Calloway, treasurer (interview)</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="table-responsive mb-3">
    <table class="table table-sm align-top mb-0">
      <thead>
        <tr class="small text-muted">
          <th scope="col">Claim, as written</th>
          <th scope="col">Sourcing</th>
          <th scope="col">To firm it up</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td class="claim-text">The board voted 5-2 on March 12 to put the Fenwick Street garden lot up for sale.</td>
          <td><span class="claim-state claim-state-sourced">Sourced</span></td>
          <td class="small">Check the 5-2 count against the roll call in the minutes.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="claim-text">The lot was appraised at $84,000 last year.</td>
          <td><span class="claim-state claim-state-unsourced">Unsourced</span></td>
          <td class="small">Ask the treasurer for the appraisal report itself.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="claim-text">Gardeners were not told before the vote.</td>
          <td><span class="claim-state claim-state-unsourced">Unsourced</span></td>
          <td class="small">Ask two or three gardeners when they first heard.</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="row g-4 small">
    <div class="col-md-4">
      <h3 class="h6 section-rule">Affected but not heard</h3>
      <ul class="mb-0">
        <li>Gardeners who grow food on the lot</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-4">
      <h3 class="h6 section-rule">Words that lean</h3>
      <ul class="mb-0">
        <li><strong>&ldquo;furious&rdquo;</strong>: a strong feeling stated as fact</li>
        <li><strong>&ldquo;rushed it through&rdquo;</strong>: a judgement the dates would show</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-4">
      <h3 class="h6 section-rule">Questions to ask</h3>
      <ul class="mb-0">
        <li>Who did the appraisal, and can you see the report?</li>
        <li>Were other ways to pay for the roof discussed?</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="text-center text-muted small mt-4">
    AI-generated. A checklist, not a ruling: it never says whether a claim is true, and it never writes the story.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="text-center mt-5 pb-4">
  <% unless signed_in? %>
    <%= link_to "Check your own notes &rarr;".html_safe, sign_up_path, class: "btn btn-primary" %>
  <% end %>
  <div class="mt-3 text-muted small">
    Open source &middot;
    <a href="https://unityupdates.com" class="text-muted">UnityUpdates</a>
  </div>
</div>
